From 974237940098a49ddb56b96d5ffc7b7cb91a6c09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FIG <fig@zyntro.ai>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 21:41:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(deps): restore requirements.txt

Root requirements.txt was missing, causing pip install to fail immediately
after checkout/setup-python succeeded.

Restored with pinned versions compatible with Python 3.12 and the existing
FastAPI boilerplate stack.

Ref: ZYNTRO-ISSUE-CI-228
---
 requirements.txt | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 requirements.txt

diff --git a/requirements.txt b/requirements.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..36a473a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/requirements.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# ZyntroAI FastAPI Python Boilerplate — Dependencies
